{"version":1,"content":"<p>蘋果首款折疊機iPhone Duo上周才領到新機，就出現首批螢幕裂紋瑕疵。</p><p>網友貼出螢幕損壞原因各不相同，有的是跌落，有的與開合受力有關。</p><p>中國內地市場則開始有電商推出補貼價，也就是以低於定價促銷。</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T08:00:30.736949+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":99,"images":0,"source":"明報 中國","fallback":"rss-blocked","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T07:18:49+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T11:18:27.252277+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T07:58:04.602332+00:00","content_hash":"27e5403f43567e5f9f591c197e21d07a9e08615ecec30f745d0987092c4afa3b","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}